    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "This new approach has enabled the originally apical‐in spheroids (that show no motility on day 0 as shown on Figure 1b.1) to became motile by day 7 (Figure 1b.2), featuring highly motile ciliary appendages on the spheroid surface." ;
